    note: "Peer-reviewed genomic study (Anim Genet. 2018 Jun;49(3):237-241, PMID 29624701) identifying the autosomal recessive single-base insertion c.3149_3150insC in exon 1 of C17H2orf71 (C2orf71 / PCARE, rcd4-PRA) as the cause of late-onset progressive retinal atrophy diagnosed in the Old Danish Pointing Dog since the late 1990s."
